[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3608290039","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/113476#issuecomment-3608290039","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113476","id":3608290039,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7XEiL3","user":{"login":"aaronp64","id":136198872,"node_id":"U_kgDOCB462A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/136198872?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronp64","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronp64/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-03T18:41:44Z","updated_at":"2025-12-03T18:54:20Z","body":"I'm seeing the same issue, seems to happen for any Node types, and happens in both 2D and 3D views.  If no node is selected, double-clicking visibility of a Node gives me the error `ERROR: editor/docks/scene_tree_dock.cpp:4163 - Parameter \"node\" is null.`\n\nTested on: Godot v4.6.dev (25203e24c) - Fedora Linux 42 (Workstation Edition) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 6600 (RADV NAVI23) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-12100F (8 threads) - 31.14 GiB memory\n\nMaybe related to #113332.  Double clicking to the left of a Node name selects and focuses that Node.  Double clicking on the visibility icon does not selec